{"title":"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is the center of the circle circumscribed about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/8/6f8dcf98ed1b21dbc446aa28d097d4281599c25e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/3/b531eca471721f173a0db86ea1033032462a15d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BOC=120^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"113\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/0/e20778498f7c004695ec1c29b3fb63eef05528a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AOB=140^\\circ,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"118\" height=\"16\" /> as shown. What is the degree measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/c/8dc346e26cf3978186183f97b54718b06a1802c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC?$\" width=\"63\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b30c60982d09bb805dfa3f05e0e67b63238639f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 35 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 40 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 45 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 50 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because all the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Central_angle\" title=\"Central angle\">central angles</a> of a circle add up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/3/3f3ddad6fdf3c6d399acc40e9377cc2cdc6e742a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$360^\\circ,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"39\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/2/0425f941fba136a706ecf4a59b6b55e76b7006eb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\angle BOC + \\angle AOB + \\angle AOC &amp;= 360\\\\ 120 + 140 + \\angle AOC &amp;= 360\\\\ \\angle AOC &amp;= 100. \\end{align*}\" width=\"265\" height=\"63\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1c994e4b46ec0e11538ef7bf5b8f139fe6a079a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{arc}AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/7/b57192809d05742ff8ada422ffa193075dafd1ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100^\\circ.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"38\" height=\"13\" /> Since the measure of an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Inscribed_angle\" title=\"Inscribed angle\">inscribed angle</a> is equal to half the measure of the arc it intercepts, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/f/21fdf57254d67c3587496c207cb89c671122f39b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"139\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B\">2007 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl